    "references": [
      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=LM-022#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for LM-022 (Dec. 13, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, this is a standard digivolution requirement for a Digimon card.  It references the number of your security cards, but it's not an effect.",
        "question": "Is \"[Digivolve] While you have 2 or fewer security cards, [Gabumon]: Cost 3\" a digivolution requirement added by an effect while I have 2 or fewer security cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.  Digivolution is possible as long as you have 2 or fewer security cards when you use <Blast Digivolve>.",
        "question": "Can I use <Blast Digivolve> to digivolve my [Gabumon] into this card in the hand when I have 2 or fewer security cards and an opponent's Digimon attacks?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, it can't.  Digivolution from [Gabumon] isn't possible because the digivolution requirements aren't met when you use <Blast Digivolve>.",
        "question": "If an opponent's Digimon attacks when I have 2 or fewer security cards, then an effect adds a card to my security stack so my security stack has 3 or more cards when I use <Blast Digivolve>, can my [Gabumon] digivolve into this card in the hand?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.  Digivolution from [Gabumon] is possible as long as the digivolution requirements are met when you use <Blast Digivolve>.",
        "question": "If an opponent's Digimon attacks when I have 3 security cards, then an effect removes a card from my security stack so my security stack has 2 or fewer cards when I use <Blast Digivolve>, can my [Gabumon] digivolve into this card in the hand?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.",
        "question": "If I use an effect such as P-103 [Offense Training]'s ＜Delay＞ that digivolves a Digimon, can my [Gabumon] digivolve into this card in the hand when I have 2 or fewer security cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
